cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pypic — Python for Plasma In Cells"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for reading, analyzing, and plotting plasma
  simulation output from PIC and MHD codes. Unified interface
  to multiple simulation formats (iPIC3D, BATSRUS, OpenGGCM, ...)
  with canonical field schema, normalization-aware unit
  conversion, derived quantities, and geometry-aware operators.
type: software
authors:
